5","t":"Say, \"Indeed I fear, if I should disobey my Lord, the punishment of a tremendous Day.\"","j":7,"h":13,"s":6,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"6:16","t":"He from whom it is averted that Day - [Allāh] has granted him mercy. And that is the clear attainment.","j":7,"h":13,"s":6,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"6:17","t":"And if Allāh should touch you with adversity, there is no remover of it except Him. And if He touches you with good - then He is over all things competent.","j":7,"h":13,"s":6,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"6:18","t":"And He is the subjugator over His servants. And He is the Wise, the Aware.","j":7,"h":13,"s":6,"a":18,"sd":null}],"juz":7,"hizb":13,"surahs":[6],"sajdah":false}